Magic markers cost 3500 in the BM, not 35000.  Sam also has a ton of
gold, and will buy identified gems at full market value. Sam performs
the standard "general store" shopkeeper services, which include
identify and possibly uncursing.  Credit cloning is not hard to do in
the BM, even without pets.

Killing Sam is usually achieved either with an assault rifle, or with a
stack of poisoned daggers. A scroll of earth is usually helpful to make
sure that Sam cannot attack you in melee combat.

